OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal over unexplained death of
OL,4,A'generous' man
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a man who was found dead
OL,7,Fare appealing for help to piece
OL,8,Ftogether what happened to him.
OL,10,FPolice believe Abdellah "Abby" Saber,
OL,11,F57, may have been assaulted over the
OL,12,Fweekend of 25-27 September when he
OL,13,Fattended a food festival and camped at
OL,14,FTruro in Cornwall.
OL,16,FOfficers said he was pronounced dead by
OL,17,Fa river on Tolgarrick Road, in
OL,18,FTuckingmill, near Camborne, on 29
OL,19,FSeptember. His death is being treated
OL,20,Fby as unexplained.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
